  "role": "Line brawler",
  "summary": "The Aurelian medium issued when a commander cannot choose the ground. Flexible mounts behind clean, expensive armour.",
  "lore": "More Sentinel bays have been opened than any other Aurelian store. Their practical weapon interfaces let recovered machines return to service under several kinds of owner. Local guns beside precisely fitted armour are a familiar sight, including in custodian companies whose officers publicly prefer a pure Aurelian standard. Workshops can repair the hull and service its inherited systems, but specialist work is costly and damaged Aurelian weapons still need actual replacements. Common in the register does not mean cheap in the bay.",
